---
// Same request, two endpoints. Red = Bob reading Alice's case.
const W = 900, H = 330;
---
<figure class="bep7e">
  <div class="bep7e-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Bob sends GET C-1 with his own valid token twice. The vulnerable endpoint checks only the token and the cases:read scope and returns Alice's case with 200, drawn in red. The fixed endpoint also checks that the case owner is Bob and returns 404. The store holds C-1 owned by alice and C-2 owned by bob.">
    <rect x="20" y="110" width="150" height="90" rx="10" class="box" />
    <image href="/icons/flow/mobile.svg" x="32" y="130" width="28" height="28" aria-hidden="true" />
    <text x="72" y="148" class="nm">bob</text>
    <text x="32" y="176" class="sub"><tspan data-lang-en>valid token</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>token hợp lệ</tspan></text>
    <text x="32" y="192" class="mono">cases:read</text>

    <line x1="170" y1="140" x2="240" y2="80" class="bad" /><polygon points="248,74 238,76 243,84" class="badhd" />
    <line x1="170" y1="170" x2="240" y2="236" class="ln" /><polygon points="248,242 238,240 243,232" class="hd" />

    <rect x="250" y="40" width="330" height="80" rx="10" class="badbox" />
    <text x="265" y="64" class="nm">/vulnerable/cases/C-1</text>
    <text x="265" y="86" class="sub"><tspan data-lang-en>checks: token valid, scope cases:read</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>kiểm: token hợp lệ, scope cases:read</tspan></text>
    <text x="265" y="106" class="sub"><tspan data-lang-en>never checks: whose case is it</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>không kiểm: case của ai</tspan></text>

    <rect x="250" y="200" width="330" height="80" rx="10" class="box" />
    <text x="265" y="224" class="nm">/cases/C-1</text>
    <text x="265" y="246" class="sub"><tspan data-lang-en>checks: token, scope, and owner == bob</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>kiểm: token, scope, và owner == bob</tspan></text>
    <text x="265" y="266" class="sub"><tspan data-lang-en>owner is alice: refuse</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>owner là alice: từ chối</tspan></text>

    <line x1="580" y1="80" x2="640" y2="80" class="bad" /><polygon points="650,80 640,75 640,85" class="badhd" />
    <line x1="580" y1="240" x2="640" y2="240" class="ln" /><polygon points="650,240 640,235 640,245" class="hd" />

    <rect x="650" y="40" width="230" height="80" rx="10" class="badbox" />
    <text x="665" y="68" class="nm"><tspan data-lang-en>200  alice's case</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>200  case của alice</tspan></text>
    <text x="665" y="92" class="mono">notes: suspect…</text>
    <text x="665" y="110" class="sub"><tspan data-lang-en>Bob read it</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bob đọc được</tspan></text>

    <rect x="650" y="200" width="230" height="80" rx="10" class="box" />
    <text x="665" y="228" class="nm"><tspan data-lang-en>404  no such case</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>404  không có case này</tspan></text>
    <text x="665" y="252" class="sub"><tspan data-lang-en>same answer as a missing id</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>giống hệt khi id không tồn tại</tspan></text>

    <text x="450" y="312" text-anchor="middle" class="sub"><tspan data-lang-en>store: C-1 owner alice · C-2 owner bob</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>kho dữ liệu: C-1 của alice · C-2 của bob</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>One valid token, one id that is not his, two endpoints. The only difference is one comparison against the record's owner.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Một token hợp lệ, một id không phải của Bob, hai endpoint. Khác biệt duy nhất là một phép so sánh với owner của bản ghi.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .bep7e { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .bep7e-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .bep7e svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 700px; height: auto; }
  .bep7e text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .bep7e .nm { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 15px; }
  .bep7e .sub { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12.5px; }
  .bep7e .mono { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12.5px; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; }
  .bep7e .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .bep7e .badbox { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; }
  .bep7e .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .bep7e .hd { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .bep7e .bad { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .bep7e .badhd { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep7e figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
